Silicon Labs Si2146/2147/2148/2157/2158/2177 silicon tuner. Used by
both WinTV-dualHD variants (DVB and 01595 ATSC). The same upstream
driver covers all six chip variants — board attach picks the right
one via the i2c_device_id `driver_data` field.

Run scripts/fetch-lifted.sh before building.
